  "prefLabel": "Ban 1104.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 1104.01 Purpose and Scope. This part imposes requirements for fidelity bond coverage to indemnify New Hampshire chartered financial institutions against losses resulting from dishonest or fraudulent acts of officers, employees and agents of the institution, and acts such as robbery, burglary or forgery by persons not associated with the institution.\n\nSource. #4025, eff 3-26-86, EXPIRED 3-26-92\n\nNew. #6536, eff 7-2-97, EXPIRED: 7-2-05\n\nNew. #9767, eff 8-21-10, EXPIRED: 8-21-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ban1100.html"
